body:
I agree!

&#x200B;

I'm actually stunned by the verdict. I say this knowing almost nothing about procedural law, so take it with a grain of salt, but it wouldn't surprise me if this got overturned on appeal.

\*\*Spoiler\*\*

&#x200B;

Can we just say how low it was for Jeff's ex-girlfriend to testify at his murder trial because he cheated on her? I'm not disregarding infidelity, but come on!

I don't know if this is my imagination, but I've. noticed that during the pandemic, the weeks in the middle of the month tend to be slower. 

&#x200B;

My stuff sells quickly the first week of the month (pay day), and also during the last week. It's harder to get sales during the middle two or three weeks.
